    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about \"small actions\" though. it feels like a drop in the ocean. the data is everywhere, the tipping points are already being hit... it's hard to see the point in even trying to prepare for a future that's basically already been decided. it's just so exhausting to keep pretending like there's a way out when the trajectory is so clear.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
